rength and accuracy to become a slicing master!\n{1169096235408829}\n\n**Unlocking Fruit:**\n\nUnlock new fruits and increase the excitement as you progress in the game. Discover and slice a wide variety of fruits!\n{1509469300368651}", "short_description": "In this immersive VR game, players can slice and dice fruits in a variety of fun and exciting ways, unlocking new cutting tools and challenges as they progress. Experience the thrill of cutting fruits with an axe and unlocking new fruits to keep the action going!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tretastudios.com/vrprivacypolicy.php", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "TretaStudios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://tretastudios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25185006654419134"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 4, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1393463945822067"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1583773119301385"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1187920706027882"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1182598943745562"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1187920706027882"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1769454000, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1393463945822067"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes"